    "pdfPageStart": 86,
    "pdfPageEnd": 86
  },
  "rulesText": "As the GM, you have GM moves that change the story in response to the players’ actions. GM moves aren’t bound by specific spells or effects—when you make a GM move, you can describe the action in whatever way the fiction demands.\n\nGM moves happen during GM turns. A GM turn begins when the spotlight passes to them and ends when the spotlight passes back to the players.",
  "htmlPage": {
